{"id":2060,"date":"2016-11-17T07:55:19","date_gmt":"2016-11-17T07:55:19","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=2060"},"modified":"2016-11-30T16:57:26","modified_gmt":"2016-11-30T16:57:26","slug":"social-event-visiting-the-amsterdam-light-festival","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2016\/social-event-visiting-the-amsterdam-light-festival\/","title":{"rendered":"Social event: visiting the Amsterdam Light Festival"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-2061 size-medium\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/ii_1586df5a2a48a1d5-300x203.png\" alt=\"ii_1586df5a2a48a1d5\" width=\"300\" height=\"203\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/ii_1586df5a2a48a1d5-300x203.png 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/ii_1586df5a2a48a1d5.png 364w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-medium wp-image-2062\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/image002.png@01D24035.02172000-300x147.png\" alt=\"image002-png01d24035-02172000\" width=\"300\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/image002.png@01D24035.02172000-300x147.png 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/image002.png@01D24035.02172000.png 570w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/>Our social event will offer you an unique way to get to know Amsterdam, by boat. We will visit the fifth edition of the<a href=\"https:\/\/amsterdamlightfestival.com\/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\u00a0Amsterdam Light Festival<\/a>, which is organised from December 1st until January 22nd and will light up Amsterdam. Over 35 artworks from international artists, designers and architects find their way to the city of Amsterdam. The artworks are partly located alongside the Amsterdam canals. A\u00a075-minute boat tour on original Frisian\/Dutch Tjalk boats will take us along, under and through spectacular light artworks. In the meantime, drinks and bites will be served.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-2065\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/ii_1586e05ce489b215-300x226.png\" alt=\"ii_1586e05ce489b215\" width=\"300\" height=\"226\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/ii_1586e05ce489b215-300x226.png 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/11\/ii_1586e05ce489b215.png 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/>After the boat trip, we will have dinner at\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.restaurantvanpuffelen.com\/en\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Restaurant Cafe Van Puffelen<\/a>. Restaurant\u00a0Cafe van Puffelen is located on the Prinsengracht. In the middle of the Jordaan district, in the area around the characteristic \u2019Negen Straatjes\u2019 (nine little streets): they couldn\u2019t have had a better location. Once just a small and authentic Amsterdam \u2018bruin cafe\u2019 (brown bar), but after a couple of expansions Restaurant Cafe van Puffelen has become a hotspot in the city and a place that every \u2018Amsterdammer\u2019 knows.<\/p>\n<p>We are convinced that you will have a unique Amsterdam experience and we will make it an event you will not quickly forget.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Time schedule:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>17:15 &#8211; leave NKI by bus<\/p>\n<p>17:45\/18:00 &#8211; board the Tjalk boats and start of the boat trip<\/p>\n<p>19:30 &#8211; end of boat trip and disembark at Prinsengracht \/ Caf\u00e9\/Restaurant Van Puffelen<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Dress code: warm<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our social event will offer you an unique way to get to know Amsterdam, by boat. We will visit the fifth edition of the\u00a0Amsterdam Light Festival, which is organised from December 1st until January 22nd and will light up Amsterdam. &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2016\/social-event-visiting-the-amsterdam-light-festival\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2127,"parent":1812,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2060","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2060","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2060"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2060\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2067,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2060\/revisions\/2067"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1812"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2127"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2060"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}